! HVAC system type of every zone from the xlsx (Zone and HVAC System Summary, HVAC System Type Dictionary): 7 VAV with reheat (chilled water cooling, hot-water fossil fuel boiler) for the basement, the ground floor, the corridors and the banquet / dining / kitchen zones, 16.1 four-pipe fan-coil with DOAS (chilled water cooling, hot-water fossil fuel boiler) for the guest rooms. The xlsx names the HVAC system of each zone (raw_data column I). All equipment data are EnergyPlus defaults.
! Two thermostats: guest rooms and common areas (xlsx Schedule Summary: Heating Set Point and Cooling Set Point, space types Guest Rooms and Common Areas).
