    Base_S_OccGuestRoom_ClgSP_Sch;!- Cooling Setpoint Schedule Name  Source: xlsx Schedule Summary 'Cooling Set Point', rows 557 (Mon - Fri) (Guest Rooms), rows 557/558/559 (Mon - Fri/Sat/Sun).

